LABEL="Release 140: AR-2, the v2 archive. Every v2 /explain job (Tutor startExplain, /interactive, Edit) is written once per attempt to the media bucket under explain-archive/<date>/<id>.json at its terminal transition (the job record, its result and the user id, never the email); a failed write is logged and never fails the job. Server code only, no migrations, no config change. Stacked on release 139."
